    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1461">

                <pb facs="1162" n="1152" sameAs="frus:frus1949v08/pg1152"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">125.9531/11–1449: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Peiping</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Clubb</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-11-14T16:00:00+08:00">November 14,
                            1949—4 p. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received November 15—2:55 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1999. Re Contel 1941 [<hi rendition="#italic">1943</hi>], November 8. Letter
                    November 8 to Chou En-lai re Tsingtao property returned by mail today without
                    acknowledgment or comment.</p>
                <p>Tor reference, please inform Peiping any developments favorable or otherwise re
                    matter.</p>
                <p>Sent Department 1999. Department pass Tsingtao.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Clubb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
